<view class="page member-page">
  <view class="member-heading"><text class="eyebrow">SWEETNESS COMES WITH PRIVILEGES</text><text class="serif title">属于你的，暖棕礼遇。</text><text class="muted small">把每一次光临，变成下一次期待。</text></view>
  <view class="membership-card"><view class="row between"><text class="eyebrow">WARM BROWN / MEMBER</text><image src="/assets/icons/crown-cream.png" mode="aspectFit"/></view><text class="serif card-name">{{member.loggedIn ? member.nickname : '暖棕小屋的朋友'}}</text><view class="row between"><text>{{member.level || '普通会员'}}</text><text class="card-id">LOCAL DEMO ACCOUNT</text></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{!member.loggedIn}}" class="login-callout"><text class="small muted">使用本地演示账户体验会员权益，无需手机号授权。</text><button class="btn" bindtap="login">一键演示登录</button></view>
  <view class="member-assets"><view data-route="wallet" bindtap="open"><text class="asset-value">¥{{balanceText}}</text><text class="small muted">演示储值余额 →</text></view><view data-route="points" bindtap="open"><text class="asset-value">{{member.points || 0}}</text><text class="small muted">可用积分 →</text></view><view data-route="coupons" bindtap="open"><text class="asset-value">{{couponCount}}</text><text class="small muted">可用优惠券 →</text></view></view>
  <view class="benefit-section"><text class="eyebrow">LITTLE PERKS, EVERY DAY</text><text class="serif section-title">每一位朋友，都被珍惜</text><view class="benefit"><text class="benefit-index">01</text><view><text class="benefit-title">普通会员 · 日常的甜</text><text class="muted small">领取专属优惠券；完成订单按实付金额累计积分，每满 1 元获得 1 积分。</text></view></view><view class="benefit"><text class="benefit-index">02</text><view><text class="benefit-title">VIP 会员 · 多一点心意</text><text class="muted small">累计模拟储值满 200 元升级 VIP。享储值赠金与会员身份展示，赠金可用于余额支付。</text></view></view><view class="benefit"><text class="benefit-index">03</text><view><text class="benefit-title">让积分，继续带来美好</text><text class="muted small">在积分小铺兑换优惠券；取消订单不发放积分，完成订单仅发放一次。</text></view></view></view>
  <view class="record-section"><view class="row between"><text class="serif section-title">最近的成长记录</text><text class="small link" data-route="points" bindtap="open">查看全部 →</text></view><view wx:if="{{!records.length}}" class="muted small no-record">还没有记录，下一次美味就是新的开始。</view><view wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="id" class="record-row"><view><text>{{item.description}}</text><text class="muted small">{{item.dateText}}</text></view><text>{{item.amountText}} 分</text></view></view>
  <view class="member-footer"><button class="btn" data-route="wallet" bindtap="open">前往模拟储值</button><text class="small muted">所有会员、积分及余额均为本地课程演示数据。</text></view>
</view>
